note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology\">../batch14/58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}subbase}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S(S,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\nS\\subseteq\\tau\n\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\n\\exists F\\subseteq S\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\n\\land\\forall B\\in F\\;(x\\in B)\n\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\bigl((\\forall B\\in F\\;(y\\in B))\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top\\text{-}subbase}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S(S,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land\nS\\subseteq\\tau\n\\land\n\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\n\\exists F\\subseteq S\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\n\\land\\forall B\\in F\\;(x\\in B)\n\\land\\forall y\\in X\\;\\bigl((\\forall B\\in F\\;(y\\in B))\\to y\\in U\\bigr)\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Finite intersections of subbasic sets form a base; the empty intersection is explicitly interpreted as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"i